q q .501961 .501961 .501961 rg BT 9.6 TL/F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 241.6818 19.84252 Tm T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54.18898 779.3701 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F3 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm (Ans.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54.18898 521.3701 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 242.5 Tm (HTML, CSS and JavaScript are three important technologies that work together to develop a modern webpage.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf <48544d4c2096205374727563747572653a>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (HTML defines what content appears on the webpage and how that content is structured. It creates headings,)Tj T* (paragraphs, images, links, tables, forms and other elements.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf <43535320962050726573656e746174696f6e3a>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (CSS defines how the HTML content looks. It controls colors, fonts, sizes, spacing, borders, alignment, page layout)Tj T* (and responsive design.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf <4a6176615363726970742096204265686176696f723a>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (JavaScript adds behavior and functionality to the webpage. It can respond to clicks, validate forms, change content)Tj T* (dynamically, perform calculations and communicate with web servers.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf (Example:)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( In a login page, HTML creates the username and password fields, CSS makes the form attractive and)Tj T* (properly arranged, and JavaScript can validate the entered information before submission.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf (In short:)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( HTML = Structure | CSS = Presentation | JavaScript = Behavior.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54.18898 496.3701 cm .752941 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F3 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm (Q10. Short Answer)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54.18898 472.3701 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F3 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm (Ans.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54.18898 214.3701 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 242.5 Tm (a. What is the role of Bootstrap in web development?)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (Bootstrap is a frontend framework that provides a collection of ready-to-use CSS classes, responsive grid layouts)Tj T* (and user-interface components. It helps developers build websites that work well on different screen sizes, such as)Tj T* (desktops, tablets and mobile phones. It also reduces the amount of custom CSS required for common interface)Tj T* (elements such as buttons, navigation bars, forms and cards.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf (b. What is jQuery and why was it widely used in web development?)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (jQuery is a JavaScript library that provides simpler methods for common client-side tasks. It makes DOM)Tj T* (manipulation, event handling, animations and AJAX requests easier to write. It became widely used because)Tj T* (developers could perform common JavaScript operations with less code and it helped address differences between)Tj T* (browsers. Although modern JavaScript provides many features that reduce the need for jQuery, it remains an)Tj T* (important part of web development history.)Tj T* T*/F2 9.5 Tf (c. What is React.js and what problem does it solve in frontend development?)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (React.js is a JavaScript library used to create interactive and dynamic user interfaces. It allows developers to divide)Tj T* (a webpage into reusable components, such as buttons, navigation bars, forms and cards. React also provides an)Tj T* (efficient approach to updating the user interface when application data changes. This component-based approach)Tj T* (makes large frontend applications easier to develop, reuse, test and maintain.)Tj T* ET Q Q
